  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8211;</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>&#8211;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8211;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0120_9fccda147457.png\" style=\"width: 515px; height: 391px;\" /></p><p>So, the region bounded by the given curves, i.e., pairs of straight lines, is a square.</p><p>Now, length of side of square<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo></math>distance between parallel lines&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p>"
  }
